OL,3,GNEWSABlind world tennis champion
OL,4,Acredits family for win
OL,5,
OL,6,FA visually impaired man who was
OL,7,Fvictorious at the World Blind Tennis
OL,8,FChampionships has credited his win to
OL,9,Fhis family's support throughout his
OL,10,Ftraining.
OL,12,FIvan Rodriquez Deb, 21, from Watford,
OL,13,FHertfordshire, was crowned world
OL,14,Fchampion after winning every match in
OL,15,Fhis category (B4) at the tournament in
OL,16,FVilnius, Lithuania, last month.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
