OL,3,GNEWSABlind world tennis champion
OL,4,Acredits family for win
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe athlete said his achievement
OL,7,Frequired "a massive investment from
OL,8,Ffamily members" and credits his mum,
OL,9,FAnita Deb, for getting him involved in
OL,10,Fvisually impaired (VI) tennis at the
OL,11,Fage of 13.
OL,13,F"My mum was the one who initially took
OL,14,Fme to tennis lessons and then found VI
OL,15,Ftennis and has seen pretty much all of
OL,16,Fmy matches," he added.
